WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.481 --> 00:00:02.519
- This is good for when you drive.

00:00:03.284 --> 00:00:04.809
Driving with one hand,

00:00:04.809 --> 00:00:06.722
eating your burrito with the other.

00:00:07.676 --> 00:00:08.504
No?

00:00:08.504 --> 00:00:13.305
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:18.222
We eat pizza in LA, we
just put salad on it.

00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:30.467
That works, that works.

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:33.595
It's like salad and breadsticks had a baby

00:00:33.595 --> 00:00:36.765
and then formed a pizza 'cause it doesn't

00:00:36.765 --> 00:00:37.720
really taste like pizza.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.516
It tastes more like salad and bread.

00:00:42.456 --> 00:00:44.528
We're in downtown LA at Ramen Hood

00:00:44.528 --> 00:00:49.120
where I'm about to eat a
vegan Ramen with a vegan egg.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:53.287
As in laid by a tofurkey, not a chicken.

00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:55.989
So the white part is made of soy milk

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:00.032
and the yellow part is nutritional yeast.

00:01:00.032 --> 00:01:01.739
I guess you can't poke the yolk

00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:03.294
to have it spill out.

00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:05.323
Now for the ramen part.

00:01:06.536 --> 00:01:08.080
The important part to ramen

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.116
is obviously the noodles

00:01:09.116 --> 00:01:11.256
but more importantly is the broth.

00:01:13.911 --> 00:01:15.177
Oh yeah.

00:01:21.126 --> 00:01:22.792
Here's a delicious hot dog.

00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:24.377
It's a carrot hot dog.

00:01:24.377 --> 00:01:26.611
A hot dog made from carrots.

00:01:26.611 --> 00:01:28.806
See, underneath all the brussels sprouts,

00:01:28.806 --> 00:01:30.356
that's a carrot.

00:01:33.702 --> 00:01:37.081
Uh, OK, gotta do the side bite.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.183
It tastes like the carrots that would be

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.028
at the bottom of a stew,
something that's been cooked

00:01:43.028 --> 00:01:44.470
for a really long time.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.245
It does not taste like a hot dog at all,

00:01:47.245 --> 00:01:49.375
but it's a fun way to eat your vegetables.

00:01:50.213 --> 00:01:51.818
We're at Kye's in Santa Monica where

00:01:51.818 --> 00:01:55.028
I just got a sushi burrito.

00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:57.843
Let's go to the car and eat it.

00:01:57.843 --> 00:01:59.733
Look at this thing.

00:01:59.733 --> 00:02:02.377
Behold, the sushi burrito.

00:02:02.377 --> 00:02:04.857
It's everything that you
would find in a burrito

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:06.970
except in a nori wrapper.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:10.017
There's pinto beans and corn

00:02:10.017 --> 00:02:11.968
and tortilla chips.

00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:14.670
If you don't like seaweed,
you're not gonna like this,

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:16.580
but it's really delicious.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.880
Tastes exactly like a burrito

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.709
except without a flour tortilla.

00:02:19.709 --> 00:02:20.766
Thumbs up.

00:02:22.616 --> 00:02:25.359
So this is organic ice cream.

00:02:25.359 --> 00:02:27.208
Very important that it's organic,

00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:30.845
has raspberry sauce, it
has chocolate crumbles,

00:02:30.845 --> 00:02:33.689
chocolate shavings, and on top salted

00:02:33.689 --> 00:02:36.534
caramel cotton candy.

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.612
I don't even know how to eat this.

00:02:42.893 --> 00:02:44.945
My mouth doesn't know what to make

00:02:44.945 --> 00:02:46.225
of this much sugar.

00:02:46.225 --> 00:02:48.724
It's like everything my mom told me

00:02:48.724 --> 00:02:51.188
not to do in one bite.

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:55.022
So if I had to crown the most LA food

00:02:55.022 --> 00:02:58.049
for this video I think it
would probably have to be

00:02:58.049 --> 00:03:01.523
the sushi burrito just because LA's known

00:03:01.523 --> 00:03:03.514
for sushi and LA's known for burritos

00:03:03.514 --> 00:03:06.623
and that was a perfect mashup.

00:03:06.623 --> 00:03:07.964
Plus it was gluten free and vegan

00:03:07.964 --> 00:03:10.042
and all that other stuff.

